window.products.push({"id":181005,"name":"Marchesa Shades of White Dinner Plate by Lenox","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M8iw9bBjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designers Georgina Chapman and Keren Craig of Marchesa, noted for their head-turning fashions, bring their innate sense of style to their newest dinnerware collection. Marchesa Shades of Blue, Grey, Teal and White exemplifies casual luxe at its best. Graduating shades of color are set on soft scallop shapes and finished with a revolutionary microwave-safe gold band. Also dishwasher safe, these romantic shapes paired with easy living convenience create an exciting dinnerware collaboration with the unique artistry and craftsmanship that only Marchesa and Lenox can offer. Easy to set: essential place setting pieces include a dinner plate, accent plate, all purpose bowl and mug. Fashionable: casual luxe brought to the table by fashion designers Georgina Chapman and Keren Craig of Marchesa, known for their head-turning red carpet gowns. Durable: crafted of durable ironstone with microwave gold banding make it ideal for everyday use.  Safe for use in the dishwasher and microwave. Mix & Match: choose from four beautiful color stories or combine them to create your own signature style. Guaranteed: the generous Lenox Lifetime Breakage Replacement Program ensures many years of worry free enjoyment. Create a stunning table in vibrant blues. Soft scalloped shapes define the edges of each pale blue dinner plate which is finished in gleaming microwave and dishwasher safe gold","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71M8iw9bBjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lenox","source_asin":"B01AXN9B4O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181005","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AXN9B4O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AXN9B4O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181006,"name":"VAMEPOLE Dresser for Bedroom, White 6 Drawer Dresser, Wood Storage Chest of Drawers Closet Organizer and Storage with Wide Drawers and Metal Ring Hand","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w+Is7EFEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Modern Style】The pure white & solid wood color patchwork look and metal ring handles exude simplicity and luxury. This chest of drawers adopts a simple modern style with a suitably vintage flavor, which makes it more versatile and matches any home style, making your room or office look neater and brighter. 【Large Storage Space】With a size of 20.07(D)*10.43(W)*4.52(H) inches of each drawer, this 6 drawer dresser has a large storage capacity, helping you win the victory against scattered clothes, files, and bits and pieces that have nowhere to go, and meet your storage needs in every possible way. And closet organizer provides an appropriate height to place the potted plant or a lamp. Dimensions: 47.24\"(W) x 13.77\"(D) x 31.5\"(H) 【High Quality & Safe Material】Made of high-class MDF (CARB P2 grade medium density fiberboard,National Standard in the US Instituted by the California Air Resources Board), the surface is painted multiple times, waterproof & anti-scratching, no peculiar smell and is easy to clean and maintain. The thick base provides stable weight-bearing capacity and e provide stable load-bearing capacity and enhance stability. VAMEPOLE white dressers will not easy to deform after years of use, scratch-proof and moisture-proof. 【Safety First】Comes with 2 sets of anti-topping device, which make the dresser more stable and prevent your kids or pets away from danger. 【Unique Slide Design】Replacing the traditional slides, VAMEPOLE drawer slides are smoother and more silent, drawers can be pulled out and closed easily and silently. It is also easier to install and can avoid the problem of misalignment of the top and bottom of traditional drawers. 【Easy to Assemble】Each board is wrapped by bubble wrap to reduce bumps in transit. When you open the package, you can get a detailed instructions manual. Following steps in order, you can assemble all parts with in 60 minutes into a complete wooden dressers. In addition, VAMEPOLE customer service team will assist you with your inquiries about the installation and stuff. All of these can greatly increase the work efficiency of the assembly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w+Is7EFEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VAMEPOLE","source_asin":"B0BWR5FB6C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181006","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWR5FB6C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWR5FB6C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
