window.products.push({"id":181129,"name":"Eglobal17 Silicone Reusable Storage Bags Vacuum Sealer Bags | Preservation of Fruits, Vegetables, Meats | Eco Friendly and BPA Free Set of 4 Clear Qua","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QAL8tQxJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Notice & Proper Use: Wash & dry storage bags & covers thoroughly before use Slide bar will be tight because of hermetic, airtight feature Remove sliding bar before heat or microwave use (slide bar is not microwaveable) Save Money: Save money and break the plastic bag habit; get the best eco-friendly substitute for plastic bags. This silicone material does not contain any fillers, phthalates, coating, PVC, BPA, BPS, BPF, or any harmful chemicals. Keeps Food Fresh No more freezer burn or ice crystals on your food. Ergonomically designed for ease of use, the silicone bags plastic sealing clip moves firmly across the groove of the bag to keep it both airtight and watertight.  Best replacement for plastic containers and ziploc bags, Saving hundreds of plastic bags and money every year By the way, our packaging is made of environmentally friendly materials.  User friendly, easy-to-clean, and safe for your health. You can use NORA bags again and again. If you don’t like using traditional plastic bags, this Reusable Silicon Bag for Foods will change your world.  Versatile silicon can be used in freezer, microwave, and you can also boil the bag. This amazing Reusable Silicon Bag for Foods is durable to all conditions. Set of 4 Quart size bags Clear so you can easily and quickly see what is inside – no more guessing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QAL8tQxJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Eglobal17","source_asin":"B07LGFCN8P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181129","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LGFCN8P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LGFCN8P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
