window.products.push({"id":181143,"name":"SALATI Fruit and Vegetable Washing Machine, Portable Automatic Vegetable Cleaner Device, USB Wireless Fruit and Vegetable Cleaner, Ultrasonic Vegetabl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PdycHKXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍓【Hydroxy Water ion Purification Technology】The fruit and vegetable purifier uses water as raw material, and realizes efficient purification in 3 steps. 1. Electrolysis: water is decomposed into OH- and H+ under the action of electrolytic substances. 2. Degradation: OH- destroys the chemical molecules of residues and cell walls, rendering them harmless. 3. Deep purification: OH- and Cl are combined to form HClO, which deeply degrades residues. 🍅【Ultrasonic Vegetable Cleaner 】Ultrasonic vegetable washing machine 60,000 rpm/5 minutes high-frequency vibration, cleaning can be completed in 5 minutes! Household kitchen gadgets, fruit cleaner in water, suitable for various containers, can purify more than 99% of residual harmful components, which is beneficial to physical preservation and storage. 🥬【Easy to Use and Clean】Fully submerge the vegetable cleaner with any food in the container, then press the power button. The machine will automatically shut down after cleaning. The top cap can be removed for deep cleaning after each use. The fruit and vegetable washing machine can use different water qualities such as tap water and filtered water. 🐟【Lightweight and Portable Food Purifier】It measures 6 x 2.3 inches and is compact enough to fit easily in your pocket or purse. Wireless charging, ready to use, mobile power can also be charged. It can be used 30 times after fully charged. Great for home kitchens, picnics, business trips and travel. 🥩【Widely Used and Safe 】The fruit and vegetables purifier is made from premium ABS plastic that is BPA free, non-toxic and odorless. 5V Direct contact without strong electricity, IPX7 waterproof. It is perfectly safe not only for cleaning food, but also for dishes, jewelry, tableware and toys etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PdycHKXAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SALATI","source_asin":"B0BJ72BDKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181143","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BJ72BDKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BJ72BDKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
