window.products.push({"id":181150,"name":"0.5-Pint Stainless Steel Professional Whipped Cream Dispenser - Durable Aluminum Cream Whipper, Whipped Cream Maker Canister,Whipping Siphon - 250ml /","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.69,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EKK2UQKVL._AC_SL1139_.jpg","description":"Do you spent time and money for delicious dessert with ice cream? Do you also trouble how to make delicious homemade chocolate mousse pie with whipped cream? Now it is time to change! Simply, you just need one whipped cream dispenser! Whipped Cream Maker will have you dispensing gourmet artisanal desserts, savory toppings, and butter with NO PRESERVATIVES in just minutes. For butter: shake dispenser 25-30 times, release N2O, open dispenser, and remove with spatula. Advantage： Strong, Durable, and Lightweight --- All-aluminum constructed body & head. Rubber Grip --- Rubber grip on the dispenser head allows for easy removal and tightening. Extra Accessories --- Three decorative tips included to make your creations extra impressive. Spare N2O charger holder and silicone gasket included. Easy to Organize --- Keep all of your accessories safe and organized with the included mesh storage bag. How to use: Put more than 30% fat content cream. Don't more than 1/2 capacity, Screw on whipper head tightly Place N2Ocharger into charger holder. Screw the charger holder until the charger content is released with a hissing sound Shake whipper briskly about 10 times or more Make cream onto cake or coffee as you like","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51EKK2UQKVL._AC_SL1139_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sindh","source_asin":"B08KRR3LGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181150","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KRR3LGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KRR3LGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
