window.products.push({"id":181253,"name":"CUDDLE DREAMS Silk Bed Blanket for All Seasons, Accented with Silk-Charmeuse Border, Naturally Soft, Breathable (Silver Gray, King 108\" × 90\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":259.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ANGJ4+u1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About CUDDLE DREAMS Mulberry Silk Bed Blanket: CUDDLE DREAMS focuses on exclusive products with natural materials to deliver premium quality and exceptional comfort.  Finely crafted with premium mulberry silk and Charmeuse borders, this exclusive blanket is suitable for all seasons, and brings a chic accent to your bedroom.  Silk Benefits: -Silk is smooth, soft and skin-friendly, plus special brushing technology, this silk fleece blanket offers supreme softness and warmth, without any irritations, better than wool.  -Silk is naturally breathable. So this silk blanket keeps you cool in the summer and warm in the winter, it is suitable for all seasons.   To protect the shape and longevity of this blanket, Dry Clean Only. It is not machine washable.  Friendly Reminder:  -Measurements could be slight different from the indicated due to hand cutting and sewing.  -Please be understood the potential color difference between pictures and actual product due to different screen display or ambient light.   Tips to Identify Real Silk:  This is not a standard test, however, it is fairly definitive! Extract a few yarns off from the fabric edge and put on flame.  Genuine silk smells like burning hair and produces black, powdery ash. It will stop burning immediately when leaving the flame.  A synthetic fiber smells like burning plastic, produces black smoke and a black ball of residue (not ash). It will continue to burn even after leaving the flame. Cotton or Viscose smells like burning paper.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ANGJ4+u1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUDDLE DREAMS","source_asin":"B079N9TRJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181253","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079N9TRJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079N9TRJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181254,"name":"Aller-Ease 105-TC Mattress Pad, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812fS4w4HsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you wake up every morning with a stuffy nose or congestion, it could be due to allergens in your pillow. With AllerEase hot water washable allergy protection pillow, it’s easy to get a better, more restful night’s sleep and wake up feeling refreshed! Our pillow offers a complete allergen barrier protection to block common household allergens like dust mites, pollen, pet dander and more from settling in your pillow.  AllerEase allergy protection pillow is a blend of 65% polyester and 35% cotton with a hypoallergenic down alternative fiber fill that provides allergy-proof comfort. The pillow can be easily washed in hot water to kill germs and bacteria. It washes and dries nicely, and the pillow does not lose its shape or get lumpy. The pillow re-fluffs with each wash, making it look and feel brand new. The standard size medium support pillow is fluffy, yet supportive. The cotton blend fabric is soft and comfortable. You will sleep better, feel better and wake up feeling refreshed and well-rested. Care Instructions: Machine wash hot, non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry on low heat. Do not iron. AllerEase is the leading brand of allergen barrier bedding. All our products provide natural allergy relief, are allergist recommended and are tested by an independent third party for durability and protection. Customer satisfaction is important to us, that's why AllerEase offers a 3-year limited warranty on our pillows. We're confident you'll love our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812fS4w4HsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aller-Ease","source_asin":"B00KW0ECPW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181254","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KW0ECPW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KW0ECPW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181255,"name":"LINSY HOME Lift Top Coffee Table with Drawers for Living Room, Modern Coffee Table Rectangle with Hidden Storage, Sturdy Metal Frame and Wood Finish, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kk67cLo0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Lift Top Ergonomic Design】 - The tabletop of this coffee table can be effortlessly elevated to a comfortable height to create a spacious workspace or dining surface while you’re sitting on the sofa. You can comfortably sit and no longer need to lean forward. 【Lockable Enduring Support】 - The quality lifting hardware with reinforced joints moves smoothly and silently while also supporting the table top steadily. The optimized lockable lift mechanism delivers long-lasting strength and stability. 【Perfect Size Fits Most of Furniture and Space】 - It's a practical coffee table yet has a stylish retro feel. The size of table top is 19.7\"D x 41.3\"W x 16.8\"H. The lifting tabletop is 24.7\"X19.7\" and it added max 7.6\" height. The top board can support 100 pounds weight and the lifting top can support 10 pounds weight. 【Unique High-standing Design】 - Our LINSY HOME lift top coffee table offers a higher height of 9.1 inches, leaving plenty of room for robot vacuums to sweep under the table with ease. 【Spacious Storage Room】 - Lift-up coffee table features pull-out hidden storage top for organization and convenience. The added drawers can effectively help prevent clutter in your living room or family room. Comes with additional space from the backside of the table for displaying your decorative items or collectibles. 【Anti-collision Protectors & Rubber Pads】 - Come with 4 anti-collision corner protectors to cover the table corners for improving safety when running or playing around. 4 rubber pads attached avoid noises when close. 【Easily Assembled & Hassle-free Purchase】 - Simply attach the legs to start enjoying your coffee table. LINSY HOME coffee table comes with step-by-step instructions and tools, you can easily put them together on your own effortlessly within 30 minutes. LINSY HOME provides satisfactory customer service and 1-year warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Kk67cLo0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LINSY HOME","source_asin":"B0B3JYBP3J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181255","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3JYBP3J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3JYBP3J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
