window.products.push({"id":181282,"name":"IMEIBAO Thin Memory Foam Pillows ,Memory Foam Pillow Ultra Slim for Back and Stomach Sleepers, 2.5'' thin 23x15x2.5 Inches, Low Profile, Flat Design f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RZfe3cDBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra Slim design】IMEIBAO thin memory foam pillows are specially designed for people lying on their stomachs or on their backs, providing good support and unparalleled comfort. It can reduce the pressure during sleep: it can reduce the pressure on the neck and back, relieve pain and stiffness. The malleable memory foam supports your head, provides stability, and helps breathing and snoring. 【High-quality sleeping pillows】IMEIBAO thin Memory foam pillows,No matter what shape it becomes, It can rebound to its original shape within five seconds. No matter what the posture is when sleeping, the pillow will not be deformed. The slow rebound sponge and ordinary sponge In contrast, it can maintain its shape to provide continuous support, never flat, no longer toss, and provide a proper balance of support and comfort. 【Premium Double Layer Pillowcase】IMEIBAO thin Memory foam pillow is made of high-quality materials, and the inner cover is a breathable cover. The outer pillowcase is made of 95% cotton and 5% spandex that is very soft, flexible, durable and easy to clean. The non-scratch zipper of the pillowcase makes it easy to remove, which is machine washable and can be easily dried. 【CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex Standard 100】IMEIBAO thin Memory foam pillow is made of polyurethane, certified by CertiPUR-US and Oeko-Tex Standard 100, and does not contain harmful substances such as formaldehyde, mercury, and other heavy metals. which is an environmentally conscious high-performance material and has excellent elasticity, durability, and temperature control. This type of memory foam technology allows you to enjoy a more comfortable and personalized sleep. 【Most Important】Our mission is to make customers sleep more comfortable. If you feel uncomfortable or have any other problems, please do not hesitate to contact us. In order to show that we are always available to help you, we promise to replace your product when there is a problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71RZfe3cDBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IMEIBAO","source_asin":"B09DF33DGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181282","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DF33DGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DF33DGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181283,"name":"Melange 18-Piece Melamine Dinnerware Set (Tuscany) | Shatter-Proof and Chip-Resistant Melamine Plates and Bowls | Dinner Plate, Salad Plate & Soup Bow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fsrxNsw9L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"\"Experience the Difference of an Authentic Melamine Dinner Set Upgrade your dinnerware set with one that blends superior durability, hassle-free maintenance, and rustic charm. Made using heavy weight melamine, these dinner plate and bowls are virtually unbreakable, keeps chips and cracks at bay, and can actually be cleaned in the dishwasher. Introduce some quirk to your dinner table with a beautiful melamine dinnerware set that doesn’t cut corners. - Heavy duty feel and break-resistant design. - Comes in multiple pack options at a price you’ll love. - Assorted colors - Dishwasher safe and 100% BPA-free. - Great for camping, RVs and outdoor use. Extra Dose of Durability Not all melamine dinner sets are created equal. Most come with a melamine content of between 30-60% that makes them weak, prone to cracks, and easy to shatter. But we’ve taken the premium approach and used higher percentage of melamine to create dinner plates and bowls that beautifully weather the rigors of everyday use Great for Outdoors No need for paper plates. Whether you’re going out camping, having an outdoor soiree, or setting off in your RV or trailer, our melamine plates and bowls complement it all with a touch of durability. Tough and hardy, this dinnerware set introduces a sense of normalcy to outdoor dining without any of the fragility. Maintenance Made Easy Get yourself melamine plates and bowls that you can actually clean in the dishwasher. While others break or crack while placed in there, our fully melamine dinner set can be safely cleaned without chipping the plates or ruining the design. Dine in Style Quirky yet cute, vintage yet modern, this colorful melamine dinnerware infuses any setting with a charm that never quits. The plates and bowls come in multiple colors and design options and are crowned by beautiful asymmetry. About Melange Melange dinnerware is all about treating you to everyday elegance. We believe fine dinner sets shouldn’t mean fragile dinner sets. We believe every meal should be complemented by dinnerware that makes you smile. That’s why we’ve used premium materials to bring on the durability, special craftsmanship to enhance the longevity, and lovely detailing to catch anyone’s eye.\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fsrxNsw9L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melange","source_asin":"B07GNQZXHQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181283","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07GNQZXHQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07GNQZXHQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
