window.products.push({"id":181400,"name":"Recycled Plastic Kids Hangers | 13.5\" Heavy Duty Big Kids Plastic Hangers | Bulk Pack Childrens Hangers Plastic, Large Toddler Hangers for Clothes | C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BziiwEXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PERFECT SIZE FOR KIDS (AGED 2 - 12yrs): Single hanger dimension of 13.5”x8.5”x.15”(diameter). Say goodbye to over stretched upper sleeves and necklines. Our kid hangers are strong and flexible enough to resist the \"sleeve to neckline tug\" garment removal process that kids are famous for. Our child hangers are 20% thicker than the standard kids hanger, perfect for heavy coats! **Please note: THESE ARE NOT BABY HANGERS- they are too long!! (refer to photo for exact hanger measurement) CUSTOM DESIGNED TO SAVE SPACE- These kids clothes hangers are made using high quality materials that are flexible and nearly unbreakable. Unlike other children hangers, our heavy duty children's closet clothes hangers will last and continue to \"hang tough\" for years to come. These slim kids hangers include 2x side notches for dresses, thin straps or accessories. With a smooth finish, our kids hangers won’t leave unwanted residue behind like velvet hangers do. NON TOXIC & SAFE FOR KIDS: Our Moodie kids clothing hangers will be the perfect edition to any kids closet. We stand by our products quality and ensure safety standards are met. Our kids hangers plastic are lead free, BPA free, Formaldehyde free and non toxic. **Please note that there may be very minor color impurities/specks in the lighter color variations due to the use of non toxic recycled plastics. For the sake of our beautiful planet, we can live with that. ♻ MADE USING RECYCLED PLASTIC: Supporting the second life of plastics initiative, our kids plastic hangers are made using recycled PP plastics. The need to stop unnecessary production of plastics globally and instead make use of what is already out there is critical. Moodie is very proud to be the first kids clothes hanger company with youth hangers made from recycled materials. BESPOKE SCANDI COLOR VARIETIES - With a modern Scandinavian design ethic in mind, these hangers for kids clothes are available in white, black, pink multi, blue multi & grey multi. Our Moodie recycled plastic kids hangers will surely combine beautifully with your child's closet or wardrobe needs with both functionality and style. Our Moodie children's hangers are sold in bulk pack sizes of 25 hangers and 50 hangers for your specific storage needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BziiwEXiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Moodie","source_asin":"B09KX1F1TD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KX1F1TD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KX1F1TD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
