window.products.push({"id":181567,"name":"DECFLO 20FT Nylon Chimney Cleaning Brush,Stiff Poly Chimney Sweeping Tool and Rods Kit-Dry Duct Clean Kit Lint Remover with Long Flexible Rods (1 Brus","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wo4FvFphL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Specification: 10* 2FT reinforced nylon rods, diameter 8 mm 1* Round stiffer brush for hard work, diameter 4 inch 1* Long soft brush for lint trimming work, diameter 2.5 inch 1 *Flexible Wire Shaft Brush 1*Drill chuck adaptor 1* Allen key 1* User manual Why choose our dryer vent brush ? High Quality Nylon Bristle ● Reinforced high quality nylon bristle ● Muiti-layer arrayed, more efficient ● High density materials, stiff & sturdy ● Hard wearing and long lifespan Mechanical Button Lock Design ● Easy to use, push and lock, press and release ● Chrome coated & anti-corrosion ● Avoid getting stuck in the vent ● No loose during any direction of rotation(clockwise or anticlockwise) ●4 direction punched fixation firmly and sturdy Flexible Reinforced Rod ●The rods are made from nylon, durable, elastic and chemically resistant. ●It has a great degree of flexibility, perfectly gets through those tough bends. How to use the brush? ● Remove your dryer vent guard. ●Attach the bristle with rods ● Insert the included drill bit into your drill. ● Connect the first rod and begin the easy cleaning process. ● Put more rods for added length per your needs. Why use dryer vent brush ? The leading cause of fires in dryers is due to lint and dust buildup. Dryer vent brush help reduce drying time, improve dryer performance, and reduce the risk of a fire caused by lint that builds up over time in the dryer duct and vent hood exiting your house. Helps extend the life of your dryer.  The best part is, you can reuse this kit year after year, saving hundreds of dollars on expensive cleaning services.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Wo4FvFphL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECFLO","source_asin":"B07Y1K4ZMM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181567","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y1K4ZMM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y1K4ZMM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
