window.products.push({"id":181703,"name":"Deco 79 Mango Wood Solid Candle Holder, Set of 3 18\", 15\", 12\"H, Brown","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qoB5s3wxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Delight your guests and make any occasion extra special by adding a lighted or flameless candle to this lantern. Made with a sturdy base, it is perfect for creating an elegant atmosphere at your table top or mantel. This mango wood candle holder set is a great decorative piece for the living room, the study room, and the dining area. Designed with felt or rubber stoppers at the base that prevent scratching furniture and table tops, as well as sliding around. Can hold 3 votive candles. This item ships in 1 carton. Mango wood candle holder makes a great gift for any occasion. Suitable for indoor use only. Made in India. This candle holder comes as a set of 3. Traditional style.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91qoB5s3wxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deco 79","source_asin":"B00U4PCI8S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00U4PCI8S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00U4PCI8S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181704,"name":"NEATERIZE Storage Bins with Lids. Set of 6 Heavy Duty Stackable MDF Covered With Fabric Storage Boxes with 2 Handle, Use for Organizing Closet, Garage","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mTaLYnWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ THE SUPERIOR SHELF ORGANIZER: Your hunt for organization and storage baskets is over thanks to NEATERIZE! These storage baskets for shelves are durable, portable and lightweight yet can effortlessly hold and organize all your stuff. Use them for clothes, purses and shoes to keep them sorted and protected from dust or accidental spills or stains that could ruin them. Perfect for storing off-season winter sweaters or summer clothes while keeping them accessible! ★ FOLDABLE STORAGE BASKETS: With six unique colors to choose from, you can use these baskets for organizing at home, at work, for teachers in the classroom, office organization and so much more. Featuring two small, two medium and two large organizing bins, you'll have the right size for the right items within easy reach at all times. Measurements are as follows: Size: 2) 8.5 x 12 x 6.5 inches. 2) 10 x 14.5 x 8. inches. 2) 12 x 16 x 10 inches. ★ MAKES A GREAT STORAGE BIN: If you're looking for a sturdy box for boys or a box for girls, you'll be glad to know that NEATERIZE storage bins make excellent boxes for kids. Plus unlike traditional bulky boxes that kids eventually grow out of, these portable containers will always find a use, even as your kids grow older and grow up. With several colors to choose from, your little ones can learn the importance of cleanliness and organization while keeping their rooms tidy ★ MAKES A GREAT BIN: If you're looking for a sturdy box for boys or a box for girls, you'll be glad to know that NEATERIZE storage bins make excellent boxes for kids. Plus unlike traditional bulky boxes that kids eventually grow out of, these portable containers will always find a use, even as your kids grow older and grow up. With several colors to choose from, your little ones can learn the importance of cleanliness and organization while keeping their rooms tidy ★ PERFECT STORAGE BASKETS FOR SHELVES: These stackable storage bins with lids free up valuable shelf and closet space quickly and easily. Stack items you don't use often and then marvel at how much space you've freed up. Even using them as decorative storage boxes will give you a large amount of space. Don't forget to check out NEATERIZE wide storage boxes and our sets of four individually sized boxes for all your organization and storage needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mTaLYnWML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NEATERIZE","source_asin":"B09R3693FN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181704","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09R3693FN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09R3693FN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
