window.products.push({"id":181827,"name":"All Season King Size Bed Comforter,Soft Down Alternative Quilted Comforter,Box Stitched,Machine Washable(White,90x102Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lkW75EUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ Extremely Soft :Filled with snow down alternative fill, a state-of-the-art fiberfill that has the feel of authentic goose and duck down without the feathers, poking or allergies. ❤ Breathable:Brushed fabric gives superior comfort against your skin; not too heavy to pressure you while you sleep.This fiberfill has super thermal ability that will keep you warm on the coldest nights, and comfortably cozy during warm seasons. ❤ Design &Craft:This oversized comforter is a masterpiece crafted with durable edges and an elegant Diamond Stitching Pattern that not only looks beautiful, but prevents the fill from shifting during the night, ensuring a comfortable sleep.No concern of filling leakage or loose thread.Corner tab design can put the comforter in place.It will never slide no matter how you twist and turn in your bed.You can use our comforter as a duvet insert, or as a stand-alone comforter. ❤ Care Instruction:Machine washable alone in gentle cycle with cold water(Don't mix with other clothes). Hang dry or tumble dry on low heat(under 30℃/89℉), which is convenient and time-saving.The Whole-piece filling would NOT SHIFT or CLUMP even after wash, with zero concern of leakage or ripping. ❤ 100% Satisfaction Guarantee:If for any reason in the first 33 days you are unsatisfied with quality of the item you received, you can return it in exchange for a new one.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lkW75EUIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luffield","source_asin":"B0995BDSRW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181827","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0995BDSRW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0995BDSRW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
