window.products.push({"id":181873,"name":"HutaoLi 3D Dinosaur Night Light - 3D Illusion Lamp Three Pattern and 7 Color Change Decor Lamp with Remote Control for Kids, Dinosaur Gifts for Kids","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812VCHevz2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"3D Illusion Dinosaur Night Light Lamp ✔Energy saving - Power spend: 0.012kw.h/24 hours; LED life span: 10000hours✔Remote control- 7 Color Change, you can control the night light by the remote or button on the base. ✔Touch Mode-Pls press the touch button one to change one color, press 7 times 7 diffent colors.if press 8th times, the colors will be changed automatically.✔Automatically mode- Press the touch button to last color, then press it again, auto color changing mode works.✔Powered by USB cable or Batteries- you can use the usb cable connecting it to USB power socket or computer USB port. if want to plug it into your wall socket, suggest use your phone adapter to match. you can also put 3-AA batteries to power. ✔How to shut down- Long touch the smart sensor switch to TURN OFF.✔3D just Visual-the lamp itself is Flat Unique Lighting Effects Amazing Optical Visual Illusion Home Decor Lamp. ✔As Decorative Light- It can be put in Home,Bars,Cafes,Hotels, Cinema,Clubs,University,Restaurant Atmosphere Light, Christmas gifts,Birthday Gifts,AdvertisingPromotional Gifts, Holiday Gifts, Tourist Attractions Gifts...ect. Product Size: ABS Base: 93 * 38mm/3.66*1.65inchProduct Weight: 0.266kg/0.58lbBox Size: 8.6 X 5.9 X 2.1 IN Package Included: 1 *Acrylic Plate (Velociraptor)1 *Acrylic Plate (Tyrannosaurus)1 *Acrylic Plate (Triceratops) 1 *ABS base1 *Remote control1 *USB cable1 *User manual NOTE: 1 - It may have a protective film on surface of the light, please tear it out before you use the light.2 - Do not touch the acrylic plate surface with your fingers to avoid finger print marks on the plate which may affect the 3D illusion 3 - 3D just visual effect, the lamp itself is flat. 100% MONEY BACK GUARANTEE If you're not satisfied, then CONTACT US and we will give you a 100% refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/812VCHevz2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HutaoLi","source_asin":"B07RXK69P3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181873","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RXK69P3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RXK69P3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
