window.products.push({"id":181974,"name":"HOMEFORT Industrial Bookcase, 5-Tier Vintage Bookshelf, Ladder-Shaped Shelf, Open Etagere Bookcases, Freestanding Display Storage Organizer, Tall Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718LFvHQfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE AND ELEGANT BOOKSHELF: Great combination of design and function, you can use it to display various items, such as CDs, printers, plants. Perfect for use in the living room to display family albums or other favorite collections, working in offices to store books, file folders, and other decorative stuff. With a mixture of wood-inspired shelves and metal frames, this bookshelf features an industrial-looking to fit with almost all other decor styles. SIMPLE YET FUNCTIONAL 5-TIER VINTAGE BOOKCASE: Reduces clutter and creates organization wherever you need to expand the storage space. This 5-tier storage rack provides additional storage space to make the fullest use of unused space around the home, such as the living room, kitchen, bathroom, office, laundry, balcony, and more. The shelves are pretty deep, so there's room for books and decorative items, making it a great way to display our book collection. ORGANIZE ALL ON THIS VINTAGE SHELVING UNIT: Made of powder-coated iron and durable MDF board, this freestanding display shelf is sturdy and stable enough to hold various kinds of stuff, such as decorative plants, books, photos, and more. Unlike the rigid metal storage rack, this contemporary bookshelf is not only physically attractive to make users feel relaxed. But also aesthetically appealing to be a decorative piece of furniture . PERFECT FOR SMALL-PLACE STORAGE, DECORATIVE AND SPACIOUS:) Without occupying too much space, its perfect size of 23.62\"Wx13.98\" Dx63.58\"H(60x35.5x161.5cm) makes it more suitable for small place storage, especially for small apartment or corridor that needs somethings higher and not wider.Item weight:23.10lbs/10.5kgs.Making rooms well organized instead of being in a mess. This portable ladder-shaped storage shelf can fit easily behind an open door in the den. HOMEFORT PROMISE: Easy to assemble with clearly-illustrated assembly instruction. Our 100% customer satisfaction policy can help you exchange it for the better or refund without any cost if the item does not meet your demand. Please feel free to contact us if you had any issues with the order via AMAZON BUYER MESSAGE. We will reply to all the inquiries within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718LFvHQfiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEFORT","source_asin":"B08R7H9MJV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R7H9MJV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R7H9MJV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181975,"name":"Cooler Lunch Tote Bag - Medium Size (11x11x8 In). 600D Oxford Fabric, 8MM Thick Insulation, Smooth Long-Lasting Zippers, Thick Peva liner, Multiple Zi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AnDF1vxBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MEDIUM SIZED COOLER TOTE LUNCH BAG- 600D STRONG OXFORD FABRIC: We used 600D long-lasting oxford fabric as compared to low grade Non Woven 300D or 420D fabric used in most other lunch bags, coolers & lunch boxes. MEDIUM SIZED COOLER BAG WITH THICK INSULATION: Thicker foam means more insulation. We used 8MM EPE foam, whereas most other lunch bags uses either 3MM or 5 MM foam MEDIUM SIZED COOLER LUNCH TOTE WITH SMOOTH SNAG-FREE BRANDED ZIPPERS: Cooler Lunch bag comes with smooth no-snag branded, long lasting zippers as compared to generic zippers most commonly used in other lunch bags, cooler bags and lunch boxes MEDIUM SIZED COOLER LUNCH BAG WITH LONG LASTING COOLING: Our 8MM EPE foam and thick heat-sealed peva liner on all sides maximizes cooling efficiency of the bag. Even though our lunch bag is leak proof, we do not recommend to put open ice or liquid directly in the bag as it will destroy insulation over time. To extend cooling, you can use ice packs/ice gels made for cooler bags and lunchboxes. STRONG CONSTRUCTION: Solid construction with reinforced stitching, durable polyester fabric, strong thick peva liner, branded smooth zippers, replaceable shoulder straps with two carrying handles. MEDIUM SIZED COOLER LUNCH BAG WITH MULTIPLE ZIPPERED POCKETS: Many compartments, pockets and internal netting pockets. Font Zippered pocket, two expandable zippered side pockets. Extra pocket at the back. A small quick access zippered pocket at front. For sports, travel, beach, picnic, hiking, carry-on, camping, Meal Prep. MULTIPLE CARRYING OPTIONS: Long adjustable and removable padded shoulder straps and two carrying. MEDIUM SIZED COOLER LUNCH BAG- SIZE/DIMENSIONS: Main compartment: Length: 11 Inches (excluding side pockets). Total Height: 11 Inches (both top & lower compartments). Width: 8 Inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91AnDF1vxBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MOJECTO","source_asin":"B09BHMN9L4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BHMN9L4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BHMN9L4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":181976,"name":"Serving Tray Set of 2 by East World (Large 17\"x13\" and Medium 13\"x9\", Torched Light Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NpKn5OeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The World May Not Be Able To Decide on Ottomans vs Coffee Tables... ... But That Doesn’t Mean You Can’t Decide on The Right Tray! There’s been a battle ensuing for a long time now. Ottoman vs Coffee Table. While one offers portability and comfort the other offers more space and stability. But of course, any smart home manager knows that a good serving tray is what makes the difference in both instances. Everyone agrees, whether you use an Ottoman or a coffee table... Or whether you’re serving breakfast in bed, the tray you choose can carry off the job with class and flair; or be a dowdy mess - unoriginal and uninspired. There’s no question, wooden trays are beautiful to behold... and the food or decor they behold becomes a thing of beauty too. So we turned the humble serving tray into a work of art with unique solid stainless steel handles and two complementary sizes to decorate your home. No Matter What YOU Put On It, This Dinner Tray is ALWAYS Picture Perfect! Set of Two Rectangle Pinewood Tray (Large and Medium) Set of Two Rectangle Pinewood Tray (Large and Medium) Large (17” x 13” x 2”, weighs 1.9lbs) Medium (13” x 9” x 2” weighs 1.4lbs) Large (17” x 13” x 2”, weighs 1.9lbs) Medium (13” x 9” x 2” weighs 1.4lbs) Natural Pine, finished to suit any decor Natural Pine, finished to suit any decor Serving tray with handles (unique black solid steel) Serving tray with handles (unique black solid steel) Each tray holds up to 44lbs! Each tray holds up to 44lbs! Beautiful as a couch tray, lap trays, beverage tray... and more! Beautiful as a couch tray, lap trays, beverage tray... and more! 30-Day Money Back Guarantee 30-Day Money Back Guarantee Close your eyes now, and imagine these trays taking centerstage in YOUR home. Now, seeing that it looks as stunning as you originally thought - order here, risk free from East World.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NpKn5OeiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"East World","source_asin":"B0829LBK84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-181976","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0829LBK84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0829LBK84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
